OL,3,GNEWSASection of town centre car park to
OL,4,Aclose for months
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a car park is set to
OL,7,Ftemporarily close to make way for
OL,8,Fbuilding work at a nearby leisure
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe changes will affect 28 of the 62
OL,12,Fparking spaces available at the St
OL,13,FJohn's Square car park in Daventry,
OL,14,Faccording to West Northamptonshire
OL,15,FCouncil.
OL,17,FIt said the partial closure will start
OL,18,Ffrom Friday, with work expected to be
OL,19,Fcompleted by April 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
