OL,3,GNEWSASection of town centre car park to
OL,4,Aclose for months
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Butler, West Northamptonshire
OL,7,FCouncil's cabinet member for Highways
OL,8,Fand Transport, said: "We recognise
OL,9,Fthese temporary access and parking
OL,10,Fchanges will cause some inconvenience
OL,11,Fand would like to thank people in
OL,12,Fadvance for their patience and
OL,13,Funderstanding during this period."
